cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this single-Spark GB10 Drama-3 + MMH3 media stack in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "SAA-Media-Avatar-Panel-Jordan: Single-Spark GB10 Drama-3 + MMH3 Audio-Locked Video Starter"
abstract: >-
  A modular, reproducible starter stack pairing a 13.80 GiB 5-language (ZH/EN/JA/KO/YUE)
  pruned INT3 quantization of Fish Audio Drama 3 running natively on TensorFold (Zig/CUDA)
  with mmh3 (Rust/CUDA) for MiniMax H3 audio-locked video generation, including a 4-slot
  LRU VoiceCachePool patch and GB10 unified-memory / async Sol-Attn / nvfp4-slim / CUDA Graph
  engine patches.
version: 1.0.0
